  <title>Dotonbori &amp; Shinsaibashi | Osaka | Kansai | Destinations | Travel Japan - Japan National Tourism Organization (Official Site)</title>


  <meta name="description" content="Hospitable Osaka established its reputation for commerce and entertainment back in the Edo period. In Shinsaibashi, and among the bright lights of the Dotonbori district, you’ll find some of the best shopping and eating in Osaka. Come and experience the liveliest and most colorful area of Osaka.">
